# Talisman of Hierarchy prints two mana abilities (CR 605.1a): "{T}: Add {C}." costs nothing, while "{T}: Add {W} or {B}.
# This artifact deals 1 damage to you." deals the damage as it resolves (a mana ability has no stack, CR 605.3b) and names its
# color as it resolves. Cast for {2} on turn 1, Bot1 taps it for {C} on turn 3 and stays at 20, for {W} on turn 5 and for {B}
# on turn 7, one damage each. The colored ability refuses red (the {W} activation is the positive control), and the
# colorless ability takes no color at all.

